<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Arbor Health started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Arbor Health started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of Arbor Health Care Co as a buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $36 a share.</p>
<p>-- expects Arbor to earn $1.71 a share on revenues of $245 million in 1997.</p>
<p>-- expects Arbor to earn $2.03 a share on revenues of $272 million in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Arbor lost 1/8 to 27-3/4.</p>
</text>
